Step - 1 Place your ships (black coloured rectangels) onto the board either by dragging and dropping or clicking the random placement button.
Step - 2 Once you've placed your ships on the board, click Start Game
Step - 3 Now you've to guess by clicking on the computer board to find a ship the computer has randomly placed. After each move, computer will also do the same.
Step - 4 Whoever guesses all the ships first will win the game.
